Billing-related API environment variables:

- STRIPE_SECRET_KEY — Stripe secret API key (required for Checkout/Portal and webhook subscription retrieval).
- STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET — Signing secret from the Stripe Dashboard webhook endpoint (required to verify POST /v1/webhooks/stripe).
- STRIPE_SUBSCRIPTION_PRICE_ID — Default recurring price id (price_…) for subscription Checkout.
- DASHBOARD_URL — Origin of the staff dashboard, no trailing slash (used for Checkout success/cancel URLs and Portal return_url).
- ENABLE_BILLING_ROUTES — When true, registers POST /v1/billing/checkout and POST /v1/billing/portal.
- ENABLE_STRIPE_WEBHOOK_ROUTES — When true, registers POST /v1/webhooks/stripe with raw-body signature verification.
- STRIPE_TRIAL_PERIOD_DAYS — Optional integer; when > 0, passed as subscription_data.trial_period_days on Checkout.

See apps/api/.env.example for a minimal template.

