Demo workspace seed (`pnpm seed:demo` from repo root; runs `apps/api/scripts/seed-demo-workspace.ts`):

- DEMO_STAFF_AUTH_USER_ID — required; `auth.users.id` of the operator who should receive a `staff_users` row for the demo business (same user you use to sign into the dashboard).
- DEMO_BUSINESS_ID — optional; if set, data is inserted into that existing business (may duplicate rows on repeat runs). If unset, a new business is created (`slug` prefix `pf-demo-`).
- DEMO_SEED_ALLOW_PRODUCTION — must be `true` to allow the script when `NODE_ENV=production`.
- Same non-local guard as customer-flow seed: set `PULSEFILL_ALLOW_CUSTOMER_FLOW_SEED=1` when `SUPABASE_URL` is not local.
